WEBVTT

01:00:58.292 --> 01:01:00.059
to do things like this,

01:01:00.083 --> 01:01:05.000
in terms of getting the legislation
in place that is needed in this hour.

01:01:07.167 --> 01:01:08.434
CA: Thanks so much.

01:01:08.458 --> 01:01:10.518
Just quick closing words
from you, Anthony,

01:01:10.542 --> 01:01:11.809
and then from you, Phil.

01:01:11.833 --> 01:01:13.726
Anthony.

01:01:13.750 --> 01:01:15.268
AR: You know, I would just say

01:01:15.292 --> 01:01:17.708
that what gives me hope
are the young folk.

01:01:18.542 --> 01:01:21.309
You have to believe that among this group,

01:01:21.333 --> 01:01:24.268
this groups of young'uns,

01:01:24.292 --> 01:01:25.601
seeing what they're seeing,

01:01:25.625 --> 01:01:29.393
living with this president,
with these instincts,

01:01:29.417 --> 01:01:31.559
seeing the continued indifference